## Recommendation

For your use case with BuyPass products:
- **Development/Testing**: Stick with `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (fast iteration)
- **Production with <10K products**: Use `all-mpnet-base-v2` (best balance)
- **Production with quality focus**: Use `all-roberta-large-v1` (if you have the resources)

The vector dimensions must match when switching models. If you change models after building an index, you'll need to:
1. Delete the existing vector index
2. Rebuild with the new model
3. The system will automatically use the new dimensions

To switch, just change the model name and restart - it will download the new model on first run.